      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "25",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nsango gwa kūtūlwa mbooko",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū banhū bilemeelwa mu mhayo gose gose, shibigelile bashike kwibanza, bakalojiwe na balamuji ū mhayo gwabo, gūgoloolwe; ū ntūngīlīja alekelwe, ū ng'hūbi inhwe nsango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'hūbi ūlū wigeleelwa nsango gwa kūtūlwa, akūlagīlwa abundaale hasī mu būtongi bo namuji, atūlwe mbooko ījo jilahamīlwe; kūlenganīla nū būhūbi bokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike yaya ū kūtūlwa mbooko ja kūkīla ha makūmi anè; nguno ū ng'wana wa ng'wing'we ūlū ūtūlwa jikīlile a henaho, akūdalahwa no ū mu miso gako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ng'ombe ūlū īlīīta nīmo gwa kūtūla",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25:4",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kūtūla:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, kūpandagīla; ī kale banhū bangī batūmamīlaga ng'ombe ū kūtūla ī shilīwa shabo (gītī būsīga); ng'ombe jabūpandagīlaga kūshisha jayūgūka pyī ī mbeke.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " būsīga, yaya ū kwītunga ū kū nomo gwayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwingīlwa kwa nchīlwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū bagosha ba myaji ūmò bakwikalaga hamò, hūna ūmò wabo ūcha alīyo atabyalile ng'wana ngosha, ū nkīma ūyo walī nke shitigelile akatoolwe hanze ya kaya yenīyo, kū babisa. Ndūgūye wa ngoshi akūng'wingīla, abize ngoshi ang'wītīle īyo yigelile kwītwa na nkwelaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wana ngosha ūyo alabyalwe kwandya akwinhwa ī lina lyakwe ūyo wazumalīkile; lītizūjimīīla ī lina lyakwe ū mu Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū munhū ng'wenūyo ūlū atatogilwe kūnsola ūyo walī nke wa ng'wana wa ng'wawe, ū nkīma ng'wenūyo akūja kū banamhala kū mita gwa nzengo akabawīle, “Ū ng'wana wa ng'wawe wa ngoshi wane atūhayaga ū kūlīgūngūmūla ī lina lya ndūgūye ū mu Isilaeli. Atatogilwe ū kūnīītīla īyo yigelile anīītīle kūlwa nguno ya ng'wana wa ng'wawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhamhala ba mu nzengo gwakwe bakūng'witana ū ngosha ng'wenūyo bahooye nang'hwe. Ūlū ongeja kūlema alīhaya, “Ū nene natatogilwe ū kūng'wingīla ū nkīma ng'wenūyo;” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ū nkīma ng'wenūyo, ū nchīlwa akūbūūka aho igashije, aje a halī nkwelaye akang'wīngīje shilatū ū kū gūgūlū ū gūmò, hūna ūnswīla na mate ga kū būshū kūnū alīng'wīla, “Akīītagwa gīkī ū munhū ūyo atatogilwe kūzenga kaya ya ng'wanong'wawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī kaya yakwe ū munhū ng'wenūyo ū mu Isilaeli īkūmanīka mu lina lya “Kaya ya ntaajiwa shilatū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū banhū babīlī bikenyaga, hūna nke wa ūmò wabo wiza kūngunanha ū ngoshi ū mu wikenya nū ng'wilwisha okwe, ūlū ūshika ūnduta ū ng'wilwisha ng'wenūyo kū wīma mbele, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ū nkīma ng'wenūyo ntīnage gete ū nkono gwakwe, yaya ū kūnsaatwa nūūlū hado.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shilagīlo kūlwa mapimīlo ga shikolo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya ū kūtūūla mu fuko gwako mawe ga kūpimīla ga mbika ibīlī, ibbūūpu n'idito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a mapimīlo ga būlīhu yaya ū kūbiza nago ga mbika ibīlī, līmò itaale līngī ido, yaya ū kwikala nago ū mu kaya yako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A mapimīlo gako ga būdito nūūlū būlīhu shiigelile gabize gatūngīlīgije gete; ū mu gīko ūkūbiza na būlamu būlīhu ū mu sī īyo SEEBA Mulungu wako alīkwinha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno a bīīti ba mihayo īlī gīko, abo batatūngīlījaga, pye a bose ba malofu ū kūlī SEEBA Mulungu wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izūkagwa ūmo akakwītīla ū Amaleki aho walī mu nzīla ūfumile Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ī likanza lyenīlo ū bebe aho walī wanoga na kūseedeeka no no no, ū wei akakūūbūkīla; ūbabūlaga pye abo walī wabaleka kū numa, abo baalī banojiwa lūgendo, atang'ogohile Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū, ū SEEBA Mulungu wako ūlū ūkwifuuja kūfuma ū kū banishi pye abo bakūpīndije ū mu sī īyo alīkwinha ībize ya wingīji wako, ūkūbamala pye a Baamaleki bashile gete a ha sīlīlī y'igūlū, yaya ū kwība.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
